1
00:00:18,899 --> 00:00:26,349
I've decided to run for student body president. If I'm going to become a senator one day, I should get some experience under my belt now.

2
00:00:26,199 --> 00:00:29,669
Andrea Jenkins is also running. She'll give you a run for your money.

3
00:00:30,179 --> 00:00:33,570
Andrea Jenkins is an idiot. I'm by far the better candidate.

4
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:36,530
Don't be so full of yourself. I'm my vote for Andrea.

5
00:00:36,880 --> 00:00:40,769
Stop kidding around. Let's get down to business. I need your help.

6
00:00:40,899 --> 00:00:42,570
You want me to help you?

7
00:00:42,780 --> 00:00:45,769
Yes. I need you to talk your friends into voting for me.

8
00:00:45,979 --> 00:00:50,210
But you've never given my friends the time of day. All you give them is the cold shoulder.

9
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:53,390
That's because they've got blue hair and nose rings.

10
00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:57,509
The better than your friends, a bunch of goody-goodies and brown nosers.

11
00:00:57,619 --> 00:01:01,890
That's beside the point. Let's talk about your friends and their votes.

12
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:07,370
Okay, you scratch my back and I'll scratch yours. If you do my chemistry homework, I'll help you get the votes.

13
00:01:07,700 --> 00:01:12,890
I'm not crazy about that idea. But okay, it's a deal. I hope I can count on you.

